# The source distribution carries the test suite whole: the tests, their conftest and reference
# data, and the benchmark package several of them import. The meshes under data/, the companion
# note's sources and the benchmarking dataset are not shipped: the tests that need them skip. The changelog and
# the release notes are shipped too: they are user documentation, and a test checks what they quote.
include CHANGELOG.md RELEASE_NOTES.md
graft tests
graft foambryo_benchmarks
global-exclude __pycache__/* *.py[cod] .DS_Store
